{"name":"Ricochet","hex":"#817c74","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ricochet","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A method of firing a projectile so that it skips along a surface.","An instance of ricocheting; a glancing rebound."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To rebound off something wildly in a seemingly random direction.","To operate upon by ricochet firing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ricochet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ricochet","blocks":[{"text":"A ricochet is a rebound, bounce, or skip off a surface, particularly in the case of a projectile. Most ricochets are caused by accident and while the force of the deflection decelerates the projectile, it can still be energetic and almost as dangerous as before the deflection. The possibility of ricochet is one of the reasons for the common firearms safety rule \"Never shoot a bullet at a flat, hard surface.\" Ricochets can occur with any caliber, but short or round ricocheting bullets may not produce the audible whine caused by tumbling irregular shapes. Ricochets are a hazard of shooting because, for as long as they retain sufficient velocity, ricocheting bullets or bullet fragments may cause collateral damage to animals, objects, or even the person who fired the shot."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/HMMWV_Tracer_Fire_dark.JPEG/330px-HMMWV_Tracer_Fire_dark.JPEG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ricochet","wikidata":"Q323227"},{"title":"Ricochet (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Trevor Mann, known by his ring name Ricochet, is an American professional wrestler. As of August 2024, he is signed to All Elite Wrestling (AEW), where he is the leader of The Demand."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Ricochet_ALL_IN_2024_08_25_127_%28headshot%29.jpg/330px-Ricochet_ALL_IN_2024_08_25_127_%28headshot%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org